   {
    "area": "Task and scoring",
    "items": [
     "<b>A start line:</b> the task clock starts when the first drone crosses a line 30 m ahead of the spawn, so take-off and looking round are not timed (<span class=\"code\">732fb769</span>).",
     "<b>Presses scored on the spot:</b> a press is correct when the hat is in the central 80% of a shown feed, in range and unobstructed; otherwise a false alarm, or outside every goal's zone (<span class=\"code\">c6b85655</span>).",
     "<b>Each run records what it flew:</b> its commit, its settings and every drone lost with its reason (<span class=\"code\">602484db</span>)."
    ],
