  "within": [
   "<b>Scoring:</b> ERKS's presses were scored at 40 m with no look-back, each counting for the goal whose zone held the formation's centre; ALEX's at 80 m, looking back 3 s, for any goal (<span class=\"code\">abef940b</span>). Presses the recorder refused that the experimenter judged correct (five of ERKS's, one of ALEX's) count as correct here (test.json <span class=\"code\">identifyOverrides</span>).",
   "<b>The wrap rule:</b> for ALEX the swarm kept its full spread while a building was inside the formation (S11's Hold, <span class=\"code\">1a4877ad</span>); for ERKS it did not.",
   "<b>The screens:</b> ERKS's hung 0.3 m below eye level, ALEX's at eye level, where the layout also no longer turned into a map when the camera pointed down (<span class=\"code\">333b53bb</span>)."
  ],
